  body: "# Employed earner in the JSA and Income Support guidance\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe
    captured chapter describes an employed earner through gainful employment in Great Britain under a
    contract of service or in an office with general earnings.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nThe source
    expressly includes some office holders and points to legislation; this is not a universal employment-law
    or tax-status determination. Memo 12/23, limited-company rules and the actual relationship require
    review. A person can have both employed and self-employed work, with separate earnings treatment.\n\
    \n## Inspected source passages\n\n- [DMG 26010, PDF page 5](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e0f9ba20b52e4144868938/dmg-Ch-26.pdf#page=5)
    — DMG Vol 5 Ch 26: Employed earners.\n- [DMG 26012, PDF page 5](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e0f9ba20b52e4144868938/dmg-Ch-26.pdf#page=5)
    — DMG Vol 5 Ch 26: Employed earners.\n- [DMG 27005, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e0f9e520b52e4144868939/dmg-Ch-27.pdf#page=4)
    — DMG Vol 5 Ch 27: Self-employed earners and share fishermen.\n\n## Evidence and review status\n\n\
    Model-assisted interpretation of selected passages in the 15 September 2026 frozen source snapshot.
    Specialist review is required. Source acquisition, source revision, legal effective dates and this
    record’s authoring time are separate.\n\nThis is an independent experimental publication, not an official
    DWP document, individual advice, an entitlement decision or an executable rule. Machine-extracted
    text may alter reading order, footnotes and characters. No PDF visual inspection, whole-chapter coverage
    or behavioural evaluation pass is claimed by this record.\n\n- `dmg-vol5-ch26`: PDF SHA-256 `fe619693d2f8cc78cac3786dadab88e81467ec56d38f00727285612af92b80c9`;
    extracted pages SHA-256 `f4089f7088e6a987d028072f4968eb39f2686b7a588e2c38f8ebc1cb3042102a`.\n\n- `dmg-vol5-ch27`:
    PDF SHA-256 `90b6c5ec739d2366936d67d78cd5a6f857b764b92000200f4a44ac956c88b3ac`; extracted pages SHA-256
    `7f84279f4a44373405ce06d32bf1c927a9f25dda507895b1540e6bb8b1b5185a`.\n"
